          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP125 - Calgary (DND)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our last cap of 4 in the group on the north shore of the Glenmore Reservoir.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
